        "start": 36.7,
        "end": 42.1
      },
      {
        "line": {
          "id": "8fe4f427-f171-57aa-b9dc-74b218335fc4",
          "source": "那好吧，乔治，告诉我你喜欢吃什么蔬菜？",
          "translation": "Well then, George, tell me what vegetables do you like?",
